    RefIds:
    - rid: 4707331672703762441
      type: {class: DistributedUIDGenerator, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Tables, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CustomEpoch: 1791631610481
    - rid: 4707331672703762649
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'World-space sign over each asylum wing door (auto-size not applied: keep it short). Two lines: {wing} big, then {room} and {status} at 60 % size separated by a middle dot. Keep the <size=60%> tag and the line break'
    - rid: 4707331672703762650
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Status word on a wing door plaque (second line, 60 % size): the wing can be entered now'
    - rid: 4707331672703762651
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Status word on a wing door plaque: the wing is open but a story piece (a mission or the key run) has it locked until a person hands over the key'
    - rid: 4707331672703762652
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Status word on a wing door plaque: this floor has been cleared already'
    - rid: 4707331672703762653
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Status word on a wing door plaque: the floor is not reachable yet'
    - rid: 4707331672703762654
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Hub hint subtitle that repeats now and then when no mission objective is active (4 s). {wing} {room} {level} are the names of the next wing
    - rid: 4707331672703762655
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Wing 1 name on its door plaque, and inside the sentences below when glued by code (ALL CAPS, short). Glossary term
    - rid: 4707331672703762656
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Wing 1 room name, plaque second line (ALL CAPS)
    - rid: 4707331672703762657
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Wing 1 storey name (GROUND FLOOR / BASEMENT / UPPER FLOOR), used in the arrival, hint and objective lines
    - rid: 4707331672703762658
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Interaction prompt at the open door of wing 1. Shown as "E  <text>" (34 pt, 600 x 50, auto-size). Imperative or infinitive
    - rid: 4707331672703762659
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Interaction prompt at the door of wing 1 while a mission or the key run has it locked
    - rid: 4707331672703762660
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Interaction prompt at the door of wing 1 once its floor is cleared
    - rid: 4707331672703762661
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Interaction prompt at the door of wing 1 before its floor can be reached
    - rid: 4707331672703762662
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle (1.8 s) when E is pressed at the cleared door of wing 1
    - rid: 4707331672703762663
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Objective card goal (big card 42 pt one line, 650 px, auto-size; compact card wraps) when the player only has to walk to the door of wing 1
    - rid: 4707331672703762664
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Arrival subtitle (5 s) when the door of wing 1 is usable. {floor} = floor number. One whole sentence: it names the door with an article'
    - rid: 4707331672703762665
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Arrival subtitle (5 s) when the door of wing 1 is locked and no order applies. {floor} = floor number
